1
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:09,750
Captain Qin.

2
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,430
The train station, docks,
long-distance bus station,

3
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:12,510
and every highway out of the city

4
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:13,880
have all been searched three times.

5
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:16,030
There's been no sign of Zhuang Haitao.

6
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,600
We've also sent people

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,760
to check the nearby towns and villages,

8
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:20,920
but no one has reported anything yet.

9
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,260
(Old Plastics Factory.
South Railway Station)

10
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,670
Zhuang Haitao would never leave Longfan.

11
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:30,550
Wait.

12
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,070
Is he stupid?

13
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:33,420
(Hekou Toll Station)
Doesn't he know he should run?

14
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:34,670
Think about it.

15
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,030
A man who could
cut out his own wife's heart

16
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:39,000
and preserve it in a bottle of alcohol

17
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,030
would definitely
find a way to retrieve it.

18
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,150
And right now, he's savoring

19
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:45,670
the suffering he's caused his victims.

20
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,840
He knows this city inside and out.

21
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,030
To him, Longfan

22
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:52,150
is both the most dangerous place

23
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,280
and the safest.

24
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,200
Think it through again.

25
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,710
Where exactly did we miss something?

26
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:04,400
Why are you staring at me?

27
00:01:04,710 --> 00:01:06,760
Aren't you staring at me?

28
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,560
What are you waiting for?

29
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,840
Go search!

30
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:09,920
Go check!

31
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,430
Didn't you hear the captain? Go check!

32
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:11,920
Get moving!

33
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:12,590
Let's go!

34
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:18,180
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 23=

35
00:01:39,950 --> 00:01:40,760
Honey.

36
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,560
In this life, you belong to me.

37
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,920
And your heart must belong to me too.

38
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:48,920
Qin Tian.

39
00:01:50,350 --> 00:01:52,350
You took away what I treasured most.

40
00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:55,400
So I'll take away
what you treasure most.

41
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:59,430
You made me live.

42
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,510
Now I'll make you realize

43
00:02:02,970 --> 00:02:04,260
you should never have saved me.

44
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,680
I wonder if that kid

45
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,240
has caught him yet.

46
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,310
Luoxia.

47
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:32,840
I need to talk to you about something.

48
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,560
Why don't you take Ming

49
00:02:35,710 --> 00:02:36,680
to the bureau for now?

50
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:37,910
It'll be safer there.

51
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:40,840
I'm not leaving.

52
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,430
If I leave, you'll worry even more.

53
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,560
We'll stay right here with you.

54
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:48,150
I'll worry even more if you stay.

55
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:50,710
Fine.

56
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,630
Dad.

57
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:05,150
Can you hear me?

58
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,590
Dad.

59
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:10,960
Can you hear me?

60
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,080
Luoxia.

61
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,000
Take our son upstairs.

62
00:03:36,310 --> 00:03:37,800
Don't ask anything. Don't look back.

63
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:50,830
Zhuang Haitao.

64
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:53,120
If you hurt my wife,

65
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,800
I'll kill you.

66
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,040
But my wife is already dead!

67
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,270
She shouldn't have died!

68
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:07,600
You killed your wife.

69
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:10,270
No. They killed her.

70
00:06:13,390 --> 00:06:14,270
Hello?

71
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,600
Liu Yan.

72
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,000
Get to the office right away.

73
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,000
It's urgent.

74
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,560
Stop wasting time.

75
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,430
Get over here now.

76
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,480
Who is this?

77
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,720
Wrong number.

78
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,310
Haitao.

79
00:06:38,630 --> 00:06:39,830
I need to go out for a while.

80
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,240
I'm just going downstairs
to buy something.

81
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:44,070
Yan.

82
00:06:48,870 --> 00:06:49,870
What do you need?

83
00:06:49,870 --> 00:06:50,630
I'll get it.

84
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:51,630
No need.

85
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,830
I'll be right back.

86
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,190
Go to sleep.

87
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:50,270
Follow that car up ahead.

88
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,120
The Urban Construction Group's
accounts from last year.

89
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,120
Want to take a look?

90
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,120
Give it to me.

91
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,510
Your signature is all over them.

92
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,800
You know what?

93
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:05,920
I'm telling you,

94
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,950
they're about
to investigate the fundraising case.

95
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:11,750
Do you know what that means?

96
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:14,510
Someone has to take the fall.

97
00:08:14,630 --> 00:08:16,160
Who do you think they'll sacrifice,

98
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:16,950
Mr. Huo or you?

99
00:08:16,950 --> 00:08:18,120
But I only did all this

100
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:20,160
because Mr. Huo told me to.

101
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:25,750
Can you prove that?

102
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,190
Do you have any evidence?

103
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:27,950
You don't, do you?

104
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:30,070
Neither do I.

105
00:08:30,750 --> 00:08:31,870
But those are your signatures.

106
00:08:31,870 --> 00:08:33,840
So when the time comes,
you'll be the one going to prison,

107
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,720
not him.

108
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,670
You're a woman who's received

109
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:39,670
special treatment from Mr. Huo.

110
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,480
Do you really think anyone

111
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,600
will believe what you say?

112
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,080
Who do you think would believe you?

113
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,720
Don't think I don't know
what you two have done.

114
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,480
He's had his eye on you

115
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,870
since your
very first day at the company.

116
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:05,790
Let me think.

117
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,360
The office,

118
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:09,960
the cafeteria,

119
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,840
and those business trips.

120
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:14,150
He certainly took good care
of you on those trips, didn't he?

121
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,120
I'm sure you don't want

122
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:21,000
your useless husband
Zhuang Haitao to find out either.

123
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,080
Don't talk about him!

124
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:25,670
Sorry.

125
00:09:27,550 --> 00:09:28,550
So right now,

126
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,200
you only have one choice.

127
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:31,320
Work with me.

128
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:33,670
You do

129
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,000
whatever I tell you to do.

130
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,550
We're just helping each other out, okay?

131
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:52,870
I need your help with this.

132
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:55,000
If you refuse,

133
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,910
I'll turn these account books

134
00:09:58,150 --> 00:09:59,000
in.

135
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,550
You'll spend a few years in prison.

136
00:10:01,550 --> 00:10:03,030
Then what will happen to your daughter?

137
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,080
Then I'll expose

138
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,840
your affair

139
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:08,440
with Mr. Huo.

140
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,840
Do you think your husband Zhuang Haitao

141
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:12,360
will still love you after that?

142
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,750
So now,

143
00:10:15,790 --> 00:10:17,150
help me get the money.

144
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,440
You'll still be

145
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,150
the Chief Financial Officer.

146
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,480
If I go to prison,

147
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:32,360
I'm taking you down with me.

148
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,600
You're still awake?

149
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:01,840
Where did you go?

150
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,390
I went to see a friend.

151
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,320
Don't drink so much.

152
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,390
Look.

153
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,550
Our daughter drew this.

154
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,480
This is Daddy.

155
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:39,840
This is her.

156
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,390
But Mommy isn't in it.

157
00:11:46,910 --> 00:11:48,670
She said Mommy is hardly ever home.

158
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:23,320
It's okay.

159
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:27,840
It's okay.

160
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:25,960
I'm begging you.

161
00:13:28,790 --> 00:13:30,320
Please spare me.

162
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:32,840
I'll give you money.

163
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,200
I don't want your money.

164
00:13:34,630 --> 00:13:35,840
I just want you dead.

165
00:13:36,150 --> 00:13:37,270
You should've known this day would come

166
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:39,320
when you laid your hands on her.

167
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:40,960
I'll make sure you know

168
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:42,480
what happens when you touch

169
00:13:42,510 --> 00:13:43,630
someone you shouldn't.

170
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,360
You have to stay alive.

171
00:14:12,790 --> 00:14:14,150
You can't die this quickly.

172
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,720
You can't die this quickly.

173
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,870
You can't die this quickly.

174
00:14:18,150 --> 00:14:20,030
I didn't say you could die.
You can't die.

175
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:30,630
Who told you to die?

176
00:14:33,510 --> 00:14:34,550
Who told you to die?

177
00:14:34,670 --> 00:14:35,720
You can't die like this!

178
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:36,750
I didn't say you could die!

179
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:37,840
You're not allowed to die!

180
00:14:38,150 --> 00:14:40,600
Come back!

181
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:28,840
You're filthy.

182
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,080
Filthy all over.

183
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,390
So I'll dry you out,

184
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,320
and steam all that filth

185
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:37,840
out of your body, little by little.

186
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:46,440
It was only later that I realized

187
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:48,120
Yan was the one
who least deserved to die.

188
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:48,910
You're back.

189
00:15:49,510 --> 00:15:51,670
The food in the kitchen is still warm.

190
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:54,120
You eat. I have to go out.

191
00:16:13,870 --> 00:16:15,840
Going to dinner with Huo Qicheng again?

192
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:18,960
Haitao.

193
00:16:19,030 --> 00:16:20,080
Don't read too much into it.

194
00:16:20,630 --> 00:16:22,320
It's just dinner with a client.

195
00:16:22,550 --> 00:16:23,870
How can I not?

196
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:27,480
Do you know what people
are saying about you?

197
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,390
What are they saying?

198
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,120
That I'm sleeping with him?

199
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:33,910
Or that I'm shameless

200
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:35,600
for getting involved with a married man?

201
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,390
You've heard all those rumors,

202
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:37,320
but have you ever asked me?

203
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,390
Asked you what?

204
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,840
So I can hear you tell me

205
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,720
that you're sleeping with Huo Qicheng?

206
00:16:45,390 --> 00:16:46,200
Yan.

207
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,360
Haven't I treated you well?

208
00:16:48,850 --> 00:16:51,320
Haven't Liang Chao and Huo Qicheng
hurt us enough?

209
00:16:52,610 --> 00:16:54,360
You said that project would make money,

210
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:55,440
so we put all our savings

211
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,510
and my parents' money into it.

212
00:16:58,150 --> 00:16:58,960
Where's the money?

213
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,360
Do you know how worried my parents are?

214
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:02,870
Yes.

215
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,440
You've been good to me.

216
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,480
I'm the one who let you down.

217
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,510
I don't deserve you.

218
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,000
Let's get divorced.

219
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:22,480
Divorced?

220
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,750
So it's true.

221
00:17:31,350 --> 00:17:32,550
Everyone's saying

222
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,750
I'm not
our daughter's biological father.

223
00:17:40,750 --> 00:17:41,680
Zhuang Haitao.

224
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,350
I've made up my mind.

225
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,680
I want a divorce.

226
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,960
There are things
I don't know how to explain to you.

227
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,440
You know our daughter has had
a hereditary heart condition

228
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:58,400
since she was little.

229
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,960
I still want her to have the surgery.

230
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,030
I can't give up on her.

231
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:03,030
And I can't afford to lose this job.

232
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:05,200
Things are too complicated
at the Urban Construction Group.

233
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:07,400
There are things
I don't want you to know.

234
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:08,830
And you don't need to know.

235
00:18:31,950 --> 00:18:36,470
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

236
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:44,310
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

237
00:18:47,030 --> 00:18:52,390
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

238
00:18:52,910 --> 00:18:58,270
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

239
00:19:00,270 --> 00:19:08,230
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

240
00:19:08,870 --> 00:19:13,910
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

241
00:19:15,950 --> 00:19:24,270
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

242
00:19:24,270 --> 00:19:30,110
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

243
00:19:31,590 --> 00:19:39,710
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

244
00:19:40,390 --> 00:19:45,430
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

245
00:19:47,230 --> 00:19:55,270
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

246
00:19:55,550 --> 00:20:02,790
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

247
00:20:02,990 --> 00:20:07,430
♪Can you hear me?♪

248
00:20:07,430 --> 00:20:11,230
♪Can you hear me?♪

249
00:20:11,230 --> 00:20:18,670
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

250
00:20:18,670 --> 00:20:26,430
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

251
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:32,350
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

252
00:20:34,230 --> 00:20:37,830
♪After all these years♪

253
00:20:40,350 --> 00:20:47,830
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

254
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:50,030
♪And tell you♪

255
00:20:51,230 --> 00:20:54,510
♪I haven't let you down♪
